Adobe Font Metrics (AFM) for the PDF Core 14 fonts
--------------------------------------------------

src/standard14/afm_tables.rs holds font metrics derived (widths
extracted) from the Adobe AFM files Helvetica.afm and Helvetica-Bold.afm, as shipped with
Apache PDFBox 3.0.3 (pdfbox/src/main/resources/org/apache/pdfbox/resources/afm/). The file
is generated by tools/fonts/afm2rs.py, which records the SHA-256 of each AFM file and of
the accompanying MustRead.html. The AFM files themselves are not distributed.

Modifications (noted as the notice below requires): only the font-level metrics (FontName,
FontBBox, Ascender, Descender, CapHeight, XHeight, StdVW, Notice) and the name and advance
width (WX) of every glyph were extracted; the per-code WinAnsiEncoding widths were computed
from them by glyph name. Kerning, ligature and glyph bounding-box data were left out.

